data.summary:
The store shows the Desk Lamp for sale, but its cart service does not recognize the lamp's product code. Each add-to-cart attempt failed and left the cart empty.
Fix the Desk Lamp catalog-to-cart product code mapping so the displayed lamp can be added to the cart, then rerun the purchase flow.
